      <activity id="cc045db1-86ea-50ec-90b5-67230d767500" activityNameId="56f16d64-6a99-5208-8d80-56231b4d3890" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Butene, mixed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Butene, mixed, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (PlasticsEurope). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air, dioxin to water. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
Synonyms: 1-butene, 1-Butan, cis-2-butene, cis-2-Butan, trans-2-butene, trans-2-Butan, isobutene, Isobutan; 
UUID: dacb7921-fc1f-3ac6-8903-c667d2bddaf4
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: 19 European production sites
Technology: product out of steam cracking of naphtha
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: 1.52Mt
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dacb7921-fc1f-3ac6-8903-c667d2bddaf4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
